    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Echoes of Me:</strong><br>A\u00a0unnerving psychological horror where your house becomes a maze of time &amp; memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a brilliant scientist obsessed with simulative technologies, your latest work has fractured something fundamental. Now, trapped in your own home, you sense something is deeply wrong. Rooms shift. Clocks lie. And something in the house knows you\u2019re awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echoes of Me pulls you into a psychological nightmare where every shadow could be you\u2014or what\u2019s left of you. As memories return in fragments and reality glitches, you must uncover the truth behind the experiment before what lurks within finds you again.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Echoes of Me:</strong><br>A\u00a0unnerving psychological horror where your house becomes a maze of time &amp; memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a brilliant scientist obsessed with simulative technologies, your latest work has fractured something fundamental. Now, trapped in your own home, you sense something is deeply wrong. Rooms shift. Clocks lie. And something in the house knows you\u2019re awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Echoes of Me pulls you into a psychological nightmare where every shadow could be you\u2014or what\u2019s left of you. As memories return in fragments and reality glitches, you must uncover the truth behind the experiment before what lurks within finds you again.</p>",
